  "implementation": "Compiled P5 admission module with closed required I/A/L/C types, recursively strict JSON (including embedded Cargo strings), stable public file identity, explicit relevant source set and existing compiler evidence/role/profile validation; single PowerShell policy/preparation function surface, main Prepare/Run fail closed.",
  "source_scope": "Only apps/crates code + root Cargo/lock/toolchain + exact9 helpers. Existing frozen captures carry extra archived rows; validate their relevant projection without walking ai-docs/.tmp/target/history. Exact before/after capture closure, graph/units/roles and current file hashes checked; no new graph builder.",
  "safety_boundaries": "No unsafe/dependency, source clock acquisition, runnable whole selector, final inventory preparation/freeze, production A/L, private/profile/key/DB/network/relay/messenger operation. Fixture-only policy lives in cfg(test) and owned public roots; outputs not_established, runtime_unavailable always errors. PS dot-source only defines functions/constants; public preparation yields bounded bytes in memory.",
  "root_clarifications": "S53 product1f404b54 differs from closure20418e41; SHA256 pins plus actual BLAKE3 of same I bytes; nested duplicate rejection precedes typed Value/maps. No cleanup success flag is admitted. Runtime safe original-clock bridge/Job/forced-cleanup/result authority remains Slice B and is not implied by numeric launch checks.",
  "windows_details": "Read-time/open-handle/post-read metadata and canonical nonreparse ancestry plus actual raw digests. Path roles compare canonical physical identities, not separator spelling; environment roles compare unique names/hashes, not locale order. Public actual junction created only inside new owned check directory with NativeToken after restricted-token access denial; no native process fixture needed.",
  "schema_detail": "32 closed wire types shared with an emitted static PS table. Required nullable fields use explicit serde deserializer; maps/arrays/reference JSON recurse through duplicate rejection. Existing nonexecuting compiler capture shape is validated; normal argv/non-test executable is distinct from shared2-package frozen input snapshot and six test artifacts.",
  "fixture_limit": "Synthetic public text EXEs, Cargo metadata and I/A/L/C lookalikes in cfg(test)-only fake workspace. They are not production activation or actual compiler/runtime provenance. Real test harness compilation is independently captured. PS final check consumes the final Rust test exported fixture and restores its raw input bytes.",
